<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1deferred__reporter" kindref="compound">deferred_reporter</ref></computeroutput> class extends <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1deferred__reporter__base" kindref="compound">deferred_reporter_base</ref></computeroutput> to provide deferred reporting functionality for a specific test expression within the framework.</para>
<para>This class is responsible for capturing the expression under evaluation, the abort status, and the source location. It is intended exclusively for internal use and is implemented in the <computeroutput>include/micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus</computeroutput> folder to ensure a structured and modular codebase. </para>
